 "title": "Jimi Hendrix In Space",
 "cat": "space",
 "emoji": "🌌",
 "sentences": [
  "Jimi Hendrix's music actually reached the Moon.",
  "His iconic song Purple Haze was inspired by a sci-fi novel about a planet bathed in purple radiance.",
  "In 2026, astronauts photographed brilliant purple auroras from 255 miles above Earth.",
  "These light shows happen when solar particles hit Earth's magnetosphere and excite oxygen and nitrogen gas.",
  "The glowing colors can mix to form purple, pink, or white.",
  "Auroras happen most near equinoxes due to the Russell-McPherron effect.",
  "NASA even used Hendrix's music as space wake-up calls."
